  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Had">Had.</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And to hadbote, gif fulbrice wurðe, toeacan þam rihtwere, æt þam seofoðan stæpe VII pund to bote, mid godcundan scrifte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in compensation for [an offence against a man in] orders, if a full breach occurs, one must pay for the seventh degree with seven pounds in addition to the legal wergild, and intercede zealously with ecclesiastical penance.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 to hadbote, gif fullbryce wurðe, toeacan þam rihtwere, æt þam seofoþam stæpe VII pund to bote, mid godcundan scrifte.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And as compensation for one in orders if a full breach of the peace occurs, one must make amends for the seventh rank with seven pounds in addition to the standard wergild, and with divine penance.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
